jlawa_202_0230_0010", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "續大典 戶典·漕轉·[諸道漕轉]", "rico:identifier": "jlawa_202_0230_0010", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:nedb:한국사DB › 법전·편람 › 續大典"}, "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/ff69fb040b8f.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/e89ce094415b.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 '한국사DB › 법전·편람 › 續大典'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/rec/q1YqVrKKVspLTUlSitVRKlGyUnq-q-fpkuVPW3coPOvYBqQObX-2Z-qLvZ2Htke_WL3jZeNkCDdWSUcpBagcSGUCqaycxPLEeCMDo3gDI2ODeAMDQwOgTClQJqOkpKDYSl8_JUkvI7O4JL-oUi89Xy-7SD8zRR-7rgKgrrdT57zauvZN0xoXJ4VHDbsUXm-a-mZBy6Htb_t2vJ7XAxaCOxSoJQ-oBewJHaVciKMKgdTrDXNebVqj8Lqj5c2CRoU3sye8mbcUKJUI8ibQUjNdQ0NdI5MQAzMrQ3MrU1OlWgA/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "기록 봉투(이미지 없음 — 기록 정보만 담은 브리지)"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "[한국사DB 원문 앞부분] 漕轉 諸道漕轉, 趁限發船上納。 忠淸道·黃海道, 二月二十日以前發船, 三月初十日內上納。全羅道, 三月十五日以前發船, 四月初十日內上納。慶尙道, 三月二十五日以前發船, 五月十五日內上納。○ 發船過限, 則該守令, 奪告身, 差使員·海運判官, 論罷, 限內發船而過限上納, 則監·色·沙·格, 杖一百定配。○ 漕運田稅, 正月未出浦守令及船隻未及整齊判官, 竝罷黜。 各倉該官員點閱領船。 湖南, 則法聖·群山兩僉使, 永定差使員, 聖堂倉漕船, 以群山差員兼領。湖西, 則以邊將中勤幹人擇差。○ 全羅·忠淸兩道都事, 俱兼海運判官。慢忽漕務, 無故上來者, 以不應爲律論。○ 海運牙山工津倉, 漕船十五隻·漕軍七百二十名, 咸悅聖堂倉, 漕船十一隻·漕軍五百二十八名, 靈光法聖倉, 漕船二十八隻·漕軍一千三百四十四名, 沃溝群山倉, 大典後新設,  (KOREA ARCHIVE 심층 판독 nedb_search)", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T06:17:55Z", "prov:used": ["nedb"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T10:16:50Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/nedb_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#7826fc8bc01ae1b5"}]}}, {"@id": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/jlawa_202_0230_0040", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "續大典 戶典·漕轉·[漕運船致敗]", "rico:identifier": "jlawa_202_0230_0040", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:nedb:한국사DB › 법전·편람 › 續大典"}, "rdfs