gh binocs, pointing, talking. Men around fire", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#12a45628bc611d53"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/DTIC_ADA429076", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "DTIC ADA429076: The Relationship between Cohesion and Casualty Rates: The 1st Marine Division and the 7th Infantry Division at Inchon and the Chosin Reservoir", "rico:identifier": "DTIC_ADA429076", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2004-06-18T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › dticarchive"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Defense%20Technical%20Information%20Center"}], "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/texts"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/DTIC%20Archive"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Wols"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Donald%20K"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/%2ACASUALTIES"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/%2AINFANTRY%20PERSONNEL"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/%2AMARINE%20CORPS%20PERS"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/a1f22ccccfea.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/aa20a918a076.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › dticarchive'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/4cdd874b2e45.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › dticarchive'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/27c71286e7ed.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › dticarchive'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/DTIC_ADA429076/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "The 1st Marine and 7th Infantry Divisions fought two campaigns in Korea between September and December 1950. These divisions' levels of unit cohesion prior to and during their deployment affected the number of men who became casualties during the 3 1/2 months of combat. Casualty rates can be affected by friendly enemy force ratios and tactical advantages, but this historical analysis shows that un", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#12a45628bc611d53"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/DTIC_ADB006731", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "DTIC ADB006731: Changjin (Chosin) Reservoir, Korea 1950: A Case Study of United States Army Tactics and Doctrine for Encircled Forces", "rico:identifier": "DTIC_ADB006731", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1975-06-06T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › dticarchive"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Defense%20Technical%20Information%20Center"}], "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/texts"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/DTIC%20Archive"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Coombs"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Robert%20M."}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/%2AWARFARE"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/MILITARY%20FORCES%28UNITED%20STATES%29"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/NORTH%20KO"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/27c71286e7ed.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/aa20a918a076.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › dticarchive'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/4cdd874b2e45.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › dticarchive'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/a1f22ccccfea.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › dticarchive'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/DTIC_ADB006731/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "The purpose of this thesis was to determine the adequacy of current U.S. Army doctrine relative to encircled units and breakout operations in view of the problems encountered by the 31st Regimental Combat Team, U.S. 7th Infantry Division, on the eastern side of the Changjin (Chosin) Reservoir in North Korea from 26 November to 2 December 1950. Tactical doctrine was defined as authoritative guidanc", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#12a45628bc611d53"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/breakoutchosinre0000russ", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Breakout : the Chosin Reservoir campaign, Korea 1950", "rico:identifier": "breakoutchosinre0000russ", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › internetarchivebooks"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Russ%2C%20Martin%2C%201931-2010"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/902e4825831f.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/434f8ea5837a.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/6e2f62b98fd7.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/11f2c98b2802.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/217b5653c2fc.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/5d93e464db45.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/3612a42fa11b.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/162ea2de7c98.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/cb65dac3e668.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/breakoutchosinre0000russ/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "452 pages : 22 cm This book tells the riveting story of one of the most heroic battles in American history. On General Douglas MacArthur's orders, a force of 12,000 U.S. Marines was marching north to the Yalu River in late November 1950. These three Marine regiments of the 1st Marine Division -- strung out along eighty miles of a narrow mountain road -- soon found themselves completely surrounded by 60,000 Chinese soldiers. Despite being given up for lost by the military brass, the 1st Marine Division fought its way out of the frozen mountains, miraculously taking their dead and wounded with t", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#12a45628bc611d53"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/colderthanhellma0000owen", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Colder than Hell : a Marine Rifle Company at Chosin Reservoir", "rico:identifier": "colderthanhellma0000owen", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2012-01-01T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › internetarchivebooks"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Owen%2C%20Joseph%20R"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/11f2c98b2802.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/902e4825831f.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/434f8ea5837a.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/6e2f62b98fd7.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/217b5653c2fc.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/5d93e464db45.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/3612a42fa11b.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/162ea2de7c98.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/cb65dac3e668.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/colderthanhellma0000owen/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "1 online resource (272 pages) During the early, uncertain days of the Korean War, World War II veteran and company lieutenant Joe Owen saw firsthand how the hastily assembled mix of some two hundred regulars and raw reservists hardened into a superb Marine rifle company known as Baker-One-Seven. As comrades fell wounded and dead around them on the frozen slopes above Korea's infamous Chosin Reservoir, Baker-One-Seven's Marines triumphed against the relentless human-wave assaults of Chinese regulars and took part in the breakout that destroyed six to eight divisions of Chinese regulars. COLDER ", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#12a45628bc611d53"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/litvin-korea-physician-inchon-chosin", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Interview with Dr. Henry Litvin (died in 2023 at age 99), Korean War physician, present at Inchon and Chosin Reservoir campaigns.", "rico:identifier": "litvin-korea-physician-inchon-chosin", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2000-06-21T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › usnavybumedhistoryoffice"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/texts"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/oral%20history"}], "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/U.S.%20Navy.%20Bureau%20of%20Medicine%20and%20Surgery"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/b6d60b08ac9b.html"}, "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/litvin-korea-physician-inchon-chosin/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Interview with Dr. Henry Litvin (died in 2023 at age 99), Korean War physician, present at Inchon and Chosin Reservoir campaigns. Conducted by Jan K. Herman, Historian, Bureau of Medicine and Surgery and CDR David Lane, MC, USN, Jenkintown, PA, 15, 21 June 2000.", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:40:43Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#12a45628bc611d53"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/lkfil-Ben_Wagner_-_The_Battle_of_the_Chosin_Reservoir", "@type": "rico:Rec