: "2002-01-01T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › nasa"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/image"}], "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/NASA%2FJPL%2FArizona%20State%20University"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/a6dcffe5fd8f.html"}, "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/PLAN-PIA03762/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "(Released 04 April 2002) This image is located in a cratered highland region called Arabia Terra. The center right side of the image shows a branch of the valley network Naktong Vallis cutting into the eastern rim of an unnamed crater. A simple sequence of geologic events can be ascertained from this image. Early on in time this surface was subjected to bombardment from asteroids and comets thereb", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:44:35Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:44:35Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#62b5df1ec0c0254f"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/mac-arthurs-war-map-naktong-bulge", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "MacArthur's War (Map - Naktong Bulge)", "rico:identifier": "mac-arthurs-war-map-naktong-bulge", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1988-01-01T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › opensource_image"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/image"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/SSG"}], "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": 