 Australia at Inchon. after two years facing the Communists on the truce line in Korea. Here troops are being carried out to the troopship by landing craft. Each man has their name and a number on a piece of paper stuck in their hats.", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:44:36Z", "prov:used": ["awm"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:44:36Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#9d06a0584c21fb9e"}]}}, {"@id": "https://www.europeana.eu/item/08602/IL5000018837", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "The N.U. to counterattack. Allied landing at Inchon.", "rico:identifier": "/08602/IL5000018837", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1950", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:europeana:Europeana › Cinecittà - Luce"}, "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/7bb8a65ae7b1.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/eca413e5cf87.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Cinecittà - Luce'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/21e76ed8c024.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Cinecittà - Luce'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/3b8681ab6dc6.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Cinecittà - Luce'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/f2cf20c47db5.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Cinecittà - Luce'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.europeana.eu/presentation/08602/IL5000018837/manifest", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "8 - the general approaches a Soviet tank on fire", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTim