hive-mcp/data/r/6563479b8d52.html"}, "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/tna/eb5ccae1/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 이미지로 구축(KOREA ARCHIVE 브리지)"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Microfilm copy of a ts diary for January 1925 - February 1927 covering his troopship voyages to and from the Far East and his appointment as the torpedo officer of the submarine depot ship HMS AMBROSE on the China Station and giving a straightforward account of his daily routine; a ts diary for January - May 1930 kept during his appointment as the torpedo officer of the battleship HMS WARSPITE, the flagship of the Mediterranean Fleet, with some interesting references to tactical exercises and other naval matters; a ts account (6pp), dated April 1932 and written during his service in the cruise", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:44:36Z", "prov:used": ["tna"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:44:36Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#9d06a0584c21fb9e"}]}}, {"@id": "https://discovery.nationalarchives.gov.uk/details/r/ec5638ac-dee4-4330-89e6-4451e79cf50d", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Six tss. letters from Lieutenant-Commander Michael Ogden to Admiral Sir William Andrewes re information about the United Nations Landing at Inchon in September 1950, on which Ogden was hoping to write a book.", "rico:identifier": "WA/23", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "11.3.63-3.12.63", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:tna:TNA › WA"}, "rico:hasOrHadHolder": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#holder/Imperial%20War%20Museum%20%28IWM%29%20Department%20of%20Documents"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/ff3377e1d2e1.html"}, "rico:h