tral European University'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/e16ca9c0b5a0.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Open Society Archives at Central European University'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/e99d28743488.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Open Society Archives at Central European University'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.europeana.eu/presentation/2022043/10891_osa_49bed0a4_5f2d_4a68_a843_cced6e44301b/manifest", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Item based on interviews conducted with defectors and immigrants in Western refugee camps and immigration offices, or Western travelers returning from stays in East European communist countries, supplemented with information collected through Radio Free Europe (RFE) correspondence with anonymous sources from behind the Iron Curtain. This item was transmitted from the Paris field office.", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:used": ["europeana"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#1756c7cddc9a238a"}]}}, {"@id": "https://www.europeana.eu/item/9200111/BibliographicResource_1000085958010", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Sverige och Koreakriget en studie av Sveriges hållning till Koreakonflikten 1947-1953", "rico:identifier": "/9200111/BibliographicResource_1000085958010", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2008", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:europeana:Europeana › Uppsala University"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#form/electronic343"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/113614807f7d.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/7133af8a1880.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Uppsala University'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.europeana.eu/presentation/9200111/BibliographicResource_1000085958010/manifest", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Diss. Umeå : Umeå universitet, 2008", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:used": ["europeana"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#1756c7cddc9a238a"}]}}, {"@id": "https://www.europeana.eu/item/9200111/BibliographicResource_1000085970856", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "A permanent landmark on the 38th parallel a study of the Armistice Agreements origin", "rico:identifier": "/9200111/BibliographicResource_1000085970856", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2009", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:europeana:Europeana › Uppsala University"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#form/electronic34"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/7133af8a1880.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/113614807f7d.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'Europeana › Uppsala University'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.europeana.eu/presentation/9200111/BibliographicResource_1000085970856/manifest", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Per definition så befinner sig Nordkorea och Sydkorea i krig med varandra sedan 25 juni 1950. Den aktiva delen av kriget varade endast i tre år och avlöstes av Armistice Agreement 27 juli 1953. Avtalet syftade till att möjliggöra för politiska företrädare att enas om ett fredsavtal – något man aldrig lyckades uppnå. Denna uppsats analyserar tiden från Kairokonferensen 1943 intill Armistice Day 195", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:used": ["europeana"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#1756c7cddc9a238a"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/cZz2ZbGZRdyX5VnyHAZQ3Dusjnccz4", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "\"THAT WAR IN KOREA \" KOREAN WAR DOCUMENTARY EVENTS OF 1950-53 COMBAT & ARMISTICE PART 2 6344", "rico:identifier": "cZz2ZbGZRdyX5VnyHAZQ3Dusjnccz4", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/movies"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Stock%20Footage"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/274d28000325.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/21f6823a94fd.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/3a0e763a5667.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/520d14ad9dc4.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/cZz2ZbGZRdyX5VnyHAZQ3Dusjnccz4/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "This is part 2 of \"That War in Korea\", an epic documentary about the Korean Conflict. The war was fought from 1950 to 1953 as North Korea invaded southern Korea. Encyclopedia Britannica produced educational films on 16mm film during the 20th century for library and school use. This is the second portion of a two part feature. It opens with images of air to air combat with P-80 Shooting Stars; (:14", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T22:56:56Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#1756c7cddc9a238a"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/cia-readingroom-document-02001999", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "CIA Reading Room 02001999: CURRENT INTELLIGENCE BULLETIN - 1951/08/08", "rico:identifier": "cia-readingroom-document-02001999", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1951-08-08T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › ciareadingroom"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/CIA%20Reading%20Room"}], "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/texts"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/CIA%20Reading%20Room"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/14fc182be82e.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/909cb1a5e8a2.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › ciareadingroom'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/cde22067e457.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › ciareadingroom'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/aa3169cae6ce.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은