chive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/nara/404791033/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 이미지로 구축(KOREA ARCHIVE 브리지)"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Original Caption: Korean villages of the Island of Cheju-Do [Jeju-Do] file back to their deserted homes which they left recently due to the communist reign of terror which spreaded over the entire island in an attempt to disrupt the UN supervised elections. These people were threatened with death if they refused to leave their village, but now the Korean Constabulary has the situation under contro", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:10:19Z", "prov:used": ["nara"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:10:19Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#67beb847b99a6fce"}]}}, {"@id": "https://catalog.archives.gov/id/505634321", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Mounted Members of the Korean Constabulary in Jeju-Do, Korea", "rico:identifier": "NAID 505634321", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:nara:NARA › RG 342 › Photographs of Activities, Facilities, and Personnel"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#level/item"}], "rico:hasOrHadHolder": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#holder/National%20Archives%20at%20College%20Park%20-%20Still%20Pictures"}], "rico:conditionsOfAccess": ["Unrestricted"], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/8796567b7eb2.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/0d9a2d2f4dbd.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'NARA › RG 342 › Photographs of Activities, Facilities, and Personnel'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/nara/505634321/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 이미지로 구축(KOREA ARCHIVE 브리지)"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Original caption: CHEJU-DO MOUNTIES - The Korean constabulary, either mounted or afoot, have proved their efficiency and reliability through working with the U. S. Military Government. These mounted police are stationed at Cheju-do, Korea, as evidenced by the Korean woman carrying her burden by shoulder straps.", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:10:19Z", "prov:used": ["nara"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:10:19Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#67beb847b99a6fce"}]}}, {"@id": "https://catalog.archives.gov/id/505634339", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Members of the Korean Constabulary March to Song in Jeju-Do, Korea", "rico:identifier": "NAID 505634339", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:nara:NARA › RG 342 › Photographs of Activities, Facilities, and Personnel"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#level/item"}], "rico:hasOrHadHolder": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#holder/National%20Archives%20at%20College%20Park%20-%20Still%20Pictures"}], "rico:conditionsOfAccess": ["Unrestricted"], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/0d9a2d2f4dbd.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/8796567b7eb2.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'NARA › RG 342 › Photographs of Activities, Facilities, and Personnel'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/nara/505634339/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 이미지로 구축(KOREA ARCHIVE 브리지)"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Original caption: KOREAN CONSTABULARY MARCHES TO SONG - Trained under the U. S. Military Government, the Korean constabulary is proving an efficient, well-disciplined organization. Picture shows a group marching to duty in Kangnung, Korea. They always march to their own songs, which sometimes resemble fierce shouts.", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:10:19Z", "prov:used": ["nara"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:10:19Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#67beb847b99a6fce"}]}}, {"@id": "https://www.koreanwar.or.kr:8443/searchDetail.do?archRfcd=2024-FR-02-DC-D-01131", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "맥아더 사건에 대한 미 정계의 입장에 대한 전보문(1951.04.15.)", "rico:identifier": "2024-FR-02-DC-D-01131", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1951-04-15", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:koreanwar:협약 › 수집 > 대한민국 > 한국학중앙연구원 > 연구사업 > 한국학분야 토대연구지원사업 > 한국전쟁 관련 프랑스외무부 자료 수집·번역 및 DB 구축"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/%EB%B3%B4%EB%84%A4%20%EC%A3%BC%EB%AF%B8%20%ED%94%84%EB%9E%91%EC%8A%A4%EB%8C%80%EC%82%AC"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/83e7ce5b7c29.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/892ba3813d60.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 '협약 › 수집 > 대한민국 > 한국학중앙연구원 > 연구사업 > 한국학분야 토대연구지원사업 > 한국전쟁 관련 프랑스외무부 자료 수집·번역 및 DB'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/7698a5211f36.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 '협약 › 수집 > 대한민국 > 한국학중앙연구원 > 연구사업 > 한국학분야 토대연구지원사업 > 한국전쟁 관련 프랑스외무부 자료 수집·번역 및 DB'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/b42bdcb2ed19.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 '협약 › 수집 > 대한민국 > 한국학중앙연구원 > 연구사업 > 한국학분야 토대연구지원사업 > 한국전쟁 관련 프랑스외무부 자료 수집·번역 및 DB'"}