ican%2C%20Kevin%20Patrick"}], "rico:isAssociatedWithPlace": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#place/Australia"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/3bbdb450fe02.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/74117f9fa202.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'AWM 유형 › Oral history'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/awm/C372921/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 이미지로 구축(KOREA ARCHIVE 브리지)"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Collection of oral history interviews on the Korean War recorded by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation (ABC) Radio National 'Hindsight' for the program 'Korea 1950-1953, The Forgotten War'. A transcript of this recording may be available. For further information please contact the Sound section.", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:15:56Z", "prov:used": ["awm"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:15:56Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#4e4f52572f40ce3e"}]}}, {"@id": "https://www.awm.gov.au/collection/C995289", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Wing Commander Clarence Edward Barrington Wilson (Ret) as an airframe fitter No 77 (Fighter) Squadron RAAF, Korea 1950-1", "rico:identifier": "S02688", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:awm:AWM 유형 › Oral history"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#form/Sound"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#form/Oral%20history"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#conflict/Korea%2C%201950-1953"}], "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Australian%20War%20Memorial"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/74117f9fa202.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/3bbdb450fe02.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'AWM 유형 › Oral history'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/awm/C995289/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 이미지로 구축(KOREA ARCHIVE 브리지)"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Wilson talks about service as a Mustang fitter in 3 Squadron, Canberra in 1949; his reasons for joining the Air Force; being engaged; his sudden posting to 77 Squadron, Iwakuni, Japan in 1951; an aircraft incident involving Lyall Klaffer, whilst in Canberra; his arrival at Iwakuni; an air fitter's duties; working conditions; the employment of Japanese nationals; sharing Iwakuni with the Americans;", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:15:56Z", "prov:used": ["awm"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:15:56Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#4e4f52572f40ce3e"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/24114-kobe-japan-world-war-2-mos-vwr", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "1951 KOREAN WAR HOME MOVIE PUSAN WEST AIR BASE BURIAL DETAIL MARINE CORPS (SILENT) 24114", "rico:identifier": "24114-kobe-japan-world-war-2-mos-vwr", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/movies"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Stock%20Footage"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/21f6823a94fd.html"}, "