stantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "A BRITISH SEAMAN ORDERED TO BE FLOGGED. JACK ON SHORE. SUNDAY'S GALE. UNLAWFUL POSSESSION. BREACH OF THE BUILDING ORDINANCE. LARCENY. DOCTOR PUNG CHAI KIN. REPAIRING A GRAVE. THE JAPANESE IN COREA.- NATIVE ACCOUNTS OF THEIR RECEPTION. PRESIDENTIAL PROGNOSTICATIONS. THE CHICAGO \"TIMES\" PRESIDENTIAL NOMINATION. THE \"HARVEST QUEEN\" COLLISION. DEATH OF REVERDY JOHNSON. FUNERAL OF REVERDY JOHNSON. MARI", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:used": ["ia·Corea 1876"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#bd2c22b537d69beb"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/cinesaurio-2025-08-14-carteleara", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "CINESAURIO 2025 08 14: CARTELERA DE ESTRENOS", "rico:identifier": "cinesaurio-2025-08-14-carteleara", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2025-08-14T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › opensource_movies"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/movies"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/Andr%C3%A9s%20Bermea"}], "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Andr%C3%A9s%20Bermea"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/804660a1201c.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/005e85d00cca.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › opensource_movies'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/0927341a203f.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › opensource_movies'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/52ab48817dd7.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › opensource_movies'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/cinesaurio-2025-08-14-carteleara/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "-¡Hola!... ¡Bienvenidos a CINESAURIO por televisión, mi nombre es Andrés Bermea y seré tu guía en esta expedición por la cartelera de estrenos en los cines de la ciudad... Llegamos a la cúspide de agosto y diría que del verano también y este fin de semana la cartelera nos ofrece al menos ¡ ocho nuevos títulos ! ¡Un bufet de cine! El realizador parisino Luc Besson (“ El 5° elemento ”, “ Nikita ”, “", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:used": ["ia·Corea 1876"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#bd2c22b537d69beb"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/concisehistoryof0002seth", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "A concise history of Korea : from antiquity to the present", "rico:identifier": "concisehistoryof0002seth", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2016-01-01T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › internetarchivebooks"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Seth%2C%20Michael%20J.%2C%201948-%20author"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/217b5653c2fc.html"}, "rico:isRelatedTo": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/902e4825831f.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/434f8ea5837a.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/6e2f62b98fd7.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/11f2c98b2802.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/5d93e464db45.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/3612a42fa11b.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/162ea2de7c98.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/cb65dac3e668.html", "rdfs:comment": "같은 계열 — 같은 기관 계층 'IA Collection › internetarchivebooks'"}], "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/concisehistoryof0002seth/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "xiv, 589 pages : 23 cm In this comprehensive yet compact book, Michael J. Seth surveys Korean history from Neolithic times to the present. He explores the origins and development of Korean society, politics, and still little-known cultural heritage, showing how this ancient, culturally and ethnically homogeneous society was wrenched into the modern world, ultimately to be arbitrarily divided into two opposed halves after World War II. Tracing the six decades since, Seth explains how the two Koreas, with their deeply different political and social systems and geopolitical orientations, evolved ", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:used": ["ia"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#878fa4f6f11dae68"}]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/mhm_maritimeheritagemn_1516", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Log Book of the USS Essex, June 10, 1883 - December 16, 1883 (#15-16)", "rico:identifier": "mhm_maritimeheritagemn_1516", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2018-01-01T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › essexlogbook"}, "rico:hasCreator": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#creator/Maritime%20Heritage%20Minnesota%2C%20Ann%20Merriman%2C%20Christopher%20Olson"}], "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#medium/texts"}, {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#subject/American%20Ships"}], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/e7ee230fce52.html"}, "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://iiif.archive.org/iiif/3/mhm_maritimeheritagemn_1516/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 제공 매니페스트"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Adams class ship USS Essex (IX-10) was designed and constructed by premier North American shipwright Donald McKay. Her keel was laid down in 1874 and she was launched in 1876. She was a three-decked wooden screw steamer sloop-of-war with auxiliary sail (bark-rigged). She was 185 feet long, 35 feet in the beam, had a 14.25-foot draft, and was 1,375 tons. When commissioned, she carried six big guns,", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:used": ["ia·Corea 1876"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#bd2c22b537d69beb"}]}}, {"@id": "https://catalog.archives.gov/id/119573130", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Case Numbers 670C-800C: Yee Jack - Mark Wing", "rico:identifier": "NAID 119573130", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:nara:NARA › RG 85 › Chinese Exclusion Act Case Files"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#level/fileUnit"}], "rico:hasOrHadHolder": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#holder/National%20Archives%20at%20Philadelphia"}], "rico:conditionsOfAccess": ["Unrestricted"], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/32a0a421aa36.html"}, "rico:hasOrHadInstantiation": {"@id": "https://korea-archive-mcp.vercel.app/iiif/nara/119573130/manifest.json", "@type": "rico:Instantiation", "rico:title": "원 기관 이미지로 구축(KOREA ARCHIVE 브리지)"}, "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:used": ["nara·Corea"], "prov:endedAtTime": "2026-11-24T23:50:32Z", "prov:wasAssociatedWith": ["KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색/cross_search"], "prov:wasInformedBy": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/provenance.json#878fa4f6f11dae68"}]}}, {"@id": "https://catalog.archives.gov/id/188375885", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "Feb. 8, 1876 - Aug. 22, 1876", "rico:identifier": "NAID 188375885", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:nara:NARA › RG 59 › Despatches from Diplomatic Officers"}, "rico:hasOrHadSubject": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#level/item"}], "rico:hasOrHadHolder": [{"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/subjects.jsonld#holder/National%20Archives%20at%20College%20Park%20-%20Textual%20Reference"}], "rico:conditionsOfAccess": ["Unrestricted"], "rdfs:seeAlso": {"@id": "https://changgi.github.io/korea-archive-mcp/data/r/6db3cc4ffcd8.ht